    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/0740a6fcb7fffc4d6086b0cb8a938311.poster.avif?t=1752686006\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/0740a6fcb7fffc4d6086b0cb8a938311.webm?t=1752686006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/0740a6fcb7fffc4d6086b0cb8a938311.mp4?t=1752686006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build an amusement park at the gates of hell to welcome the wandering souls. Satanas is counting on you \ud83d\udc79!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a colorful universe imagined by a passionate indie developer duo!  <br>Find tons of pop culture references and retro inspirations\ud83d\udc7e!   <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/d62e87262eb4d2fc6c993006b30a728e.poster.avif?t=1752686006\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/d62e87262eb4d2fc6c993006b30a728e.webm?t=1752686006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/d62e87262eb4d2fc6c993006b30a728e.mp4?t=1752686006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Build fancy rides\ud83c\udfa1</u> and design your own roller coasters\ud83c\udfa2! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Decorate your Park\ud83c\udf33</u> as you wish and find the perfect balance for your customers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/4f79f48ac220dbd22cf1374b6bd330fc.poster.avif?t=1752686006\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/4f79f48ac220dbd22cf1374b6bd330fc.webm?t=1752686006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/4f79f48ac220dbd22cf1374b6bd330fc.mp4?t=1752686006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your shops to <u>generate maximum profit\ud83e\udd11</u>! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <u>Play themed\u00a0mini-games\ud83c\udfb2</u>\u00a0to repair\u00a0your rides!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/a5260746157445f167d55e9dac2c0e74.poster.avif?t=1752686006\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/a5260746157445f167d55e9dac2c0e74.webm?t=1752686006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/a5260746157445f167d55e9dac2c0e74.mp4?t=1752686006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience and <u>unlock new objects\ud83c\udf81</u>in the progress tree!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Judge the\u00a0souls' sins\ud83d\udc7b</u> and decide who deserves to enter YOUR park!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/71e9046ef60b165f32bdb917cb292d38.avif?t=1752686006\" data-has-big width=800 height=410 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tak<u>e on challenges and win exclusive cosmestics</u> or play at your own pace! Satanas is watching you and will put you back on the right path if you mess up \ud83d\udc40.   </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/0740a6fcb7fffc4d6086b0cb8a938311.poster.avif?t=1752686006\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/0740a6fcb7fffc4d6086b0cb8a938311.webm?t=1752686006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/0740a6fcb7fffc4d6086b0cb8a938311.mp4?t=1752686006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build an amusement park at the gates of hell to welcome the wandering souls. Satanas is counting on you \ud83d\udc79!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a colorful universe imagined by a passionate indie developer duo!  <br>Find tons of pop culture references and retro inspirations\ud83d\udc7e!   <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/d62e87262eb4d2fc6c993006b30a728e.poster.avif?t=1752686006\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/d62e87262eb4d2fc6c993006b30a728e.webm?t=1752686006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/d62e87262eb4d2fc6c993006b30a728e.mp4?t=1752686006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Build fancy rides\ud83c\udfa1</u> and design your own roller coasters\ud83c\udfa2! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Decorate your Park\ud83c\udf33</u> as you wish and find the perfect balance for your customers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/4f79f48ac220dbd22cf1374b6bd330fc.poster.avif?t=1752686006\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/4f79f48ac220dbd22cf1374b6bd330fc.webm?t=1752686006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/4f79f48ac220dbd22cf1374b6bd330fc.mp4?t=1752686006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your shops to <u>generate maximum profit\ud83e\udd11</u>! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <u>Play themed\u00a0mini-games\ud83c\udfb2</u>\u00a0to repair\u00a0your rides!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/a5260746157445f167d55e9dac2c0e74.poster.avif?t=1752686006\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/a5260746157445f167d55e9dac2c0e74.webm?t=1752686006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/a5260746157445f167d55e9dac2c0e74.mp4?t=1752686006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience and <u>unlock new objects\ud83c\udf81</u>in the progress tree!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Judge the\u00a0souls' sins\ud83d\udc7b</u> and decide who deserves to enter YOUR park!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992460/extras/71e9046ef60b165f32bdb917cb292d38.avif?t=1752686006\" data-has-big width=800 height=410 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tak<u>e on challenges and win exclusive cosmestics</u> or play at your own pace! Satanas is watching you and will put you back on the right path if you mess up \ud83d\udc40.   </p></li></ul>",
